  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Milj&#xF6;st&#xF6;d Kosovo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suppoprt to preparation of KES and NEAP - Environment Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kosovo har beslutat att gneomf&#xF6;ra ett projekt kallat Support to preparation of the Kosovo Environmental Strategy (KES) och National Environmental Action Plan (NEAP) 2011-2015. Projektets huvudsakliga m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r: att en uppdaterad och reviderat KES och NEAP, har blivit brett diskuterat med intressanter och presenterad f&#xF6;r Kosovos regering innan slutet p&#xE5; mars 2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo has decided to carry out a project called Support to  preparation of the Kosovo Environmental Strategy (KES) and National Environmental Action Plan (NEAP) 2011-2015. The main objective of the project are: that an updated and revised KES and NEAP, has been bradly dicussed with stakeholders and presented to the Government of Kosovo before the end of March 2011.</narrative>
  </description>
